Phase 883: Plant Conservation Domain Admin Modules - 3 new WASM application modules:

1. modules/hieracium_admin/src/main.c (Hieracium Hawkweed Administration)
   - Base ID: 2075
   - Manages hieracium (hawkweed) invasive species monitoring and control
   - Features: infestation mapping (16 sites), spread rate tracking, control method records (mechanical/chemical/biological), effectiveness scoring, native species recovery monitoring, seed bank viability testing, herbicide resistance tracking, management cost accounting
   - Domain structs: hier_t (id, site, infest_area, spread_rate, control_method, efficacy_pct, native_count, seed_viability, resistance_idx, cost_usd, active)
   - Functions: hier_init, hier_site_map, hier_spread_monitor, hier_control_apply, hier_efficacy_assess, hier_native_recovery, hier_cost_report
   - Exports: main (demo: site mapping, spread monitoring, control application, efficacy assessment, native recovery tracking, cost report)
   - Pattern: follow modules/abelia_admin/src/main.c style

2. modules/heimia_admin/src/main.c (Heimia Bush Violet Medicinal Administration)
   - Base ID: 2076
   - Manages heimia (bush violet/lythraceae) medicinal plant cultivation
   - Features: cultivation plot records (16 plots), alkaloid extraction tracking (lythrine/decinine), growth stage monitoring, harvest optimization, extract concentration records, quality control (HPLC profiles), pharmacological testing (anti-inflammatory/analgesic scoring), traditional use documentation
   - Domain structs: heim_t (id, plot, growth_stage, alkaloid_ppm, extract_conc, quality_score, anti_inflam, analgesic, harvest_kg, use_traditional, active)
   - Functions: heim_init, heim_plot_establish, heim_alkaloid_extract, heim_quality_control, heim_pharmacology_test, heim_harvest, heim_traditional_use
   - Exports: main (demo: plot establishment, alkaloid extraction tracking, quality control, pharmacology testing, harvest records, traditional use catalog)
   - Pattern: follow modules/abelia_admin/src/main.c style

3. modules/heisteria_admin/src/main.c (Heisteria Sandalwood Family Administration)
   - Base ID: 2077
   - Manages heisteria (sandalwood family) conservation and sustainable harvest
   - Features: tree inventory (16 trees), age/size class distribution, heartwood oil content estimation, sustainable harvest planning, CITES compliance tracking, seedling propagation, mycoparasite host monitoring, essential oil yield records, carbon sequestration estimates
   - Domain structs: heist_t (id, tree_id, age_class, dbh_cm, height_m, oil_content_pct, harvest_ok, cites_permit, seedling_count, host_health, carbon_kg, active)
   - Functions: heist_init, heist_tree_inventory, heist_oil_estimate, heist_harvest_plan, heist_cites_compliance, heist_propagate, heist_carbon_estimate
   - Exports: main (demo: tree inventory, oil estimation, harvest planning, CITES compliance, propagation, carbon accounting)
   - Pattern: follow modules/abelia_admin/src/main.c style

Build all 3 modules with:
  clang --target=wasm32-unknown-unknown -Oz -nostdlib -fno-builtin -Wl,--no-entry -Wl,--export=main -o modules/<name>/<name>.wasm modules/<name>/src/main.c

